uided tour.\n\nSightseeing walks included in this application are:\n\n* Westminster Walk (10 sights)\n* Bridges of London (10 sights)\n* South Bank Walk, Part 1 (11 sights)\n* Harry Potter Trail (9 sights)\n* Shakespeare's London (6 sights)\n* South Bank Walk, Part 2 (7 sights)\n* Religious Sites (8 sights)\n* Holborn/Covent Garden Walk (11 sights)\n* Charles Dickens' London (10 sights)\n* Historic Pubs Walk (10 sights)\n* Buckingham Palace Area (7 sights)\n* East City of London Walk (11 sights)\n* Bloomsbury Museums, Part 1 (6 sights)\n* Knightsbridge Walk (12 sights)\n* Bloomsbury Museums, Part 2 (8 sights)\n* Gift and Souvenir Shopping (8 sights)\n* West End Nightlife (5 sights)\n* City Orientation Walk (13 sights)\n\nDiscovery walks included in this application are:\n\n* Antiques Hunting Walk\n* Oxford Street Area Shopping\n* St James's Walk\n* Marylebone Shopping\n* Camden Town Markets\n* Shoreditch Art Street\n* Little Venice Walk\n\nNo Data Plan or Internet is Needed, and No Roaming either. All the data used in this app is built into the software, so you can follow the city walks or use the city map without internet access or cellular data plan. No need to pay the costly roaming charges when traveling to foreign cities. The app works with your iPhone, iPod Touch or iPad.\n\nThe powerful navigation assistance includes:\n\n* Walk routes clearly displayed on map.\n* Precise walking directions from one sight to the next.\n* `FindMe` displays your exact location and Auto Tracking displays your movement on the map (this feature is not supported by the iPod Touch and iPad wifi models).\n* Built-in compass to show you the direction.\n* Create your own walks to see the attractions you like.\n* A detailed city map which can be used independently for your other traveling needs.\n\nPlease visit our website at www.GPSmyCity.com to find city walks for over 470 cities worldwide.\n\nNote: Continued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life. 